    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A mysterious algae infestation is spreading across the waters, threatening the fish population. Your goal? Rescue as many fish as possible before it\u2019s too late!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411730/extras/a75150cd19bfefa49d804485a28a8ffd.avif?t=1750093288\" width=616 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can style your frog however you like, with a wide range of outfits, accessories, and colors to create your perfect fishing buddy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411730/extras/cd15adc250ceeb95568b20e20b6b0702.poster.avif?t=1750093288\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411730/extras/cd15adc250ceeb95568b20e20b6b0702.webm?t=1750093288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411730/extras/cd15adc250ceeb95568b20e20b6b0702.mp4?t=1750093288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411730/extras/8ae35ac1e23263161ac9ddb7074dce6e.avif?t=1750093288\" width=616 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can catch over 50 different types of fish \u2013 and with a bit of luck, you might even reel in rare Shiny and dazzling Holo variants!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411730/extras/5c01c33b4d03ebab5711b3541f209b2c.poster.avif?t=1750093288\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411730/extras/5c01c33b4d03ebab5711b3541f209b2c.webm?t=1750093288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411730/extras/5c01c33b4d03ebab5711b3541f209b2c.mp4?t=1750093288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411730/extras/d4db7cd4e191c96bf5547be4537633d9.avif?t=1750093288\" width=616 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You gradually unlock various fishing spots, ranging from a peaceful lake to a bubbling volcano. Each spot offers exclusive customization items that, with a bit of luck, you might snag on your hook!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411730/extras/5ea649812b7eaeb47762c6d0899d6716.poster.avif?t=1750093288\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411730/extras/5ea649812b7eaeb47762c6d0899d6716.webm?t=1750093288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411730/extras/5ea649812b7eaeb47762c6d0899d6716.mp4?t=1750093288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A mysterious algae infestation is spreading across the waters, threatening the fish population. Your goal? Rescue as many fish as possible before it\u2019s too late!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411730/extras/a75150cd19bfefa49d804485a28a8ffd.avif?t=1750093288\" width=616 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can style your frog however you like, with a wide range of outfits, accessories, and colors to create your perfect fishing buddy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411730/extras/cd15adc250ceeb95568b20e20b6b0702.poster.avif?t=1750093288\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411730/extras/cd15adc250ceeb95568b20e20b6b0702.webm?t=1750093288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411730/extras/cd15adc250ceeb95568b20e20b6b0702.mp4?t=1750093288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411730/extras/8ae35ac1e23263161ac9ddb7074dce6e.avif?t=1750093288\" width=616 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can catch over 50 different types of fish \u2013 and with a bit of luck, you might even reel in rare Shiny and dazzling Holo variants!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411730/extras/5c01c33b4d03ebab5711b3541f209b2c.poster.avif?t=1750093288\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411730/extras/5c01c33b4d03ebab5711b3541f209b2c.webm?t=1750093288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411730/extras/5c01c33b4d03ebab5711b3541f209b2c.mp4?t=1750093288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411730/extras/d4db7cd4e191c96bf5547be4537633d9.avif?t=1750093288\" width=616 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You gradually unlock various fishing spots, ranging from a peaceful lake to a bubbling volcano. Each spot offers exclusive customization items that, with a bit of luck, you might snag on your hook!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411730/extras/5ea649812b7eaeb47762c6d0899d6716.poster.avif?t=1750093288\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411730/extras/5ea649812b7eaeb47762c6d0899d6716.webm?t=1750093288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411730/extras/5ea649812b7eaeb47762c6d0899d6716.mp4?t=1750093288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
